OL,3,ANvidia reports bumper results as firm
OL,4,Asays it's not reinstating Huang
OL,5,
OL,6,FNvidia's quarterly sales doubled to top
OL,7,F$100bn for the first time as the
OL,8,Fcompany insisted it is not reinstating
OL,9,Fousted founder Jensen Huang.
OL,11,FIn the company's first results since
OL,12,FHuang's dramatic exit, interim chief
OL,13,Fexecutive Collette Kress said it is
OL,14,F"business as usual" and told investors:
OL,15,F"We've got this."
OL,17,FThe company's quarterly sales doubled
OL,18,Ffrom a year earlier, reaching $115.8bn
OL,19,F(#86.9bn), with shares in the company
OL,20,Fjumping 5% in after-hours trading.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
