OL,3,ANvidia reports bumper results as firm
OL,4,Asays it's not reinstating Huang
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier on Tuesday, Huang said he would
OL,7,Fbe "honoured" to return and lead
OL,8,FNvidia, having quit following two
OL,9,Falleged extramarital affairs, including
OL,10,Fone with a possible spy for China.
